  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Terylene is a synthetic polyester fibre produced by polymerizing ethylene glycol and terephthalic acid which is obtained from petroleum.</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0013_ac2c64c01124.png\" style=\"width: 500px; height: 293px;\" /></p><p>IUPAC name of the ethylene glycol is Ethane-1,2-diol and name of Terephthalic acid is Benzene-1,4-dicarboxylic acid.</p></blockquote>"
